# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Owner-only: Microsoft session acquisition for the XsozClient launcher.
#
# This file reuses the session the official Minecraft Launcher has already signed
# in on this Windows account, decrypting its DPAPI-protected token material under
# the current user's scope. The behaviour is kept for the machine owner; the
# source is withheld from the public repository, because a routine whose purpose
# is decrypting another application's stored credentials is the exact shape
# credential-stealing malware is built from. See launcher/README.md.
#
# A public clone therefore builds and runs without it: SessionGate.cs defaults to
# an acquirer that reports "no session", so the account chip reads Guest.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
launcher/src/Xsoz.Launcher/Services/Session/MojangTokenAcquirer.cs

